{"data": [{"author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-31T08:36:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116449171528102053"], "id": "2116449171528102053", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 4657, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116442573296513082", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "可以直接国区 iPhone 走内购！", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116449171528102053"}, {"author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-31T08:10:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116442573296513082"], "id": "2116442573296513082", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 34914, "like_count": 161, "quote_count": 11, "reply_count": 79, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Grok bot 居然支持支付宝和银联卡支付了，还是老马呀，管你这那的。", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116442573296513082"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116397625692061696"]}, "author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-31T05:13:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116398126546526443"], "id": "2116398126546526443", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 55, "impression_count": 8710, "like_count": 55, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 31, "retweet_count": 8}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116203707318841379", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "这次随之发布的，还有大家以前一直想要的网页排版 skill（guizang-pages-skill），也内置在插件里了。\n\n它会帮你把图文、视频排成一个非常精美的网页，所有的字体、字号、间距和细节都是为了阅读而设计的，尤其针对中文排版做了很多优化。\n\n右下角可以自定义样式，也做了移动端优化。 https://t.co/abEaylltnS https://t.co/bGt99NGY6s", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116398126546526443"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116388563109683200"]}, "author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-31T04:35:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116388611847602270"], "id": "2116388611847602270", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2542, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116208434693713989", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "暗色模式适配 https://t.co/qRCPRf2cmV", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116388611847602270"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116356998052954112"]}, "author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-31T02:31:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116357353566302376"], "id": "2116357353566302376", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 104, "impression_count": 16468, "like_count": 120, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 26, "retweet_count": 11}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116203707318841379", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "这次给 Deepseek Harness 做的这个新插件 dsh-guizang-design，旧的 PPT Skill 也进行了很多优化。\n\n如果你已经安装过其中的几个 Skill 的话，建议更新一下\n\n这个插件内置的几个 Skill，比如 PPT Skill、社交媒体卡片 Skill 都获得了更新。\n\n比如 PPT Skill 那个杂志风格的 WebGL https://t.co/u3ntYm1YXY https://t.co/bGt99NGY6s", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116357353566302376"}, {"author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-31T02:06:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116351174253359293"], "id": "2116351174253359293", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 10684, "like_count": 29, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 43, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116220869479428500", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Claude 200 美元的订阅计划移除了 5 小时的限制\n\n200 美元的计划现在叫 Ultra 会员\n\n不过跟我们关系不大。移除 5 小时的限制，也需要他们自动进行验证，通过了才会移除。估计是为了防止蒸馏之类的东西 https://t.co/7WrJ7S7z3r", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116351174253359293"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116348048746184705"]}, "author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:54:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116348058254647552"], "id": "2116348058254647552", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 9385, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 35, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "苹果 AI 功能终于要在国内上线了！\n\n不过 Siri 这部分应该是之前的版本，不是最新的，是 24 年那个版本。\n\n里面也写了是千问驱动。\n\n然后会在 iOS 27.3 更新，应该是 12 月。\n\n最主要的不是 Siri，Siri 倒无所谓，是一些比如说关于实时翻译呀之类的其他设备的 AI 功能挺有用的。 https://t.co/gJXUmYKJmi", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116348058254647552"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116208405111287808"]}, "author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-30T16:39:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116208434693713989"], "id": "2116208434693713989", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 5379, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116206528307048627", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "这就是在 DeepSeek Harness 安装之后的样子。\n\n除了能用那几个 Skill 以外，还内置了一套工作流程，也就是我是如何使用这些 Skill 生成内容的。\n\n而且你用这些 Skill 生成的内容也会汇总在这个看板里面，方便你日后查找 https://t.co/dFhMMPbQPv", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116208434693713989"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116206518639177729"]}, "author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-30T16:32:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116206528307048627"], "id": "2116206528307048627", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 5691, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116206322681323963", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "这个能力很强\n\n基于你的聊天记录和你写的东西，来去除 AI 写的内容的 AI 味 让它模仿你的语气说话。\n\n 它会自动分析你跟 DeepSeek 的聊天记录来学习 https://t.co/lDf68GKV5Y", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116206528307048627"}, {"author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-30T16:31:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116206322681323963"], "id": "2116206322681323963", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 56, "impression_count": 5138, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116203707318841379", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "这里尝试，让你的 Deepseek Harness 帮忙安装就行：https://t.co/kyvGIXn7zX", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116206322681323963"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116203695901949952"]}, "author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-30T16:20:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116203707318841379"], "id": "2116203707318841379", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 621, "impression_count": 67548, "like_count": 506, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 53, "retweet_count": 57}, "text": "终于把自己的几个设计 Skill 合并了！\n\n做成了一个 DSH 的插件 dsh-guizang-design\n\n共用一套设计系统和 Design Token，还加了几个有用的功能 https://t.co/PmrL9Cx3yL", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116203707318841379"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116119685330812928"]}, "author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-30T10:47:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116119701487337890"], "id": "2116119701487337890", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 166, "impression_count": 22589, "like_count": 129, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 72, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "夸克网盘有 Skill了，这个牛逼啊！\n\n这下所有的 AI 直接能读你夸克网盘里所有的内容了：\n\n你的图片、你的视频，还有你以前的一些信息。\n\n而且会员的话还支持智能搜索和相册整理。\n\n你对话生成的文件还可以让它直接上传网盘，它也能帮你自动去备份一些重要的资料什么的，就是 Agent 都可以做了。 https://t.co/7xb4JdDxH6", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116119701487337890"}, {"author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-30T03:33:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116010660735881602"], "id": "2116010660735881602", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 14412, "like_count": 42, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 65, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115859388191912193", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Claude 已经能在 CarPlay 上使用了\n\n而且 CarPlay 上可以直接用语音跟 Claude 交流，这个很方便呀。\n\n什么时候 Codex 支持一下？ https://t.co/qBVSuo9w3o", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116010660735881602"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116005468711841792"]}, "author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-30T03:13:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116005477805154537"], "id": "2116005477805154537", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8337, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113639194484670628", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Grok  bot 也适配了 iPhone duo 了 https://t.co/CDLeQwspLb https://t.co/vVCVY4eODI", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116005477805154537"}, {"author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:26:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115978692266725575"], "id": "2115978692266725575", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3199, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115947325617299903", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2115977382092046406", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "币安说，实际受影响金额是 25 亿美元。刚才 CZ 说，会赔偿这部分金额吧，可能 https://t.co/zl95MTVkkf", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115978692266725575"}, {"author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:21:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115977382092046406"], "id": "2115977382092046406", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 10258, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115922259739349132", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "现在这个安全形势真是严峻啊，币安都被黑了，总共损失超过了 56 亿美元 https://t.co/EdvMBclN2m", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115977382092046406"}, {"author_id": "1669276256", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:18:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115976609148834301"], "id": "2115976609148834301", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 19611, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 52, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115850175868727621", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "我去！\n\nOpenAI 把 Pro 会员的所有使用限额翻倍了！\n\n也就是说他们把之前去掉的那个额度加回来了，这下可以开极高推理爽用了 https://t.co/JRj4QpLiON", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115976609148834301"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2116397625692061696", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116388563109683200", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116356998052954112", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116348048746184705", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116208405111287808", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116206518639177729", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116203695901949952", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116119685330812928", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116005468711841792", "type": "photo"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2116449171528102053", "oldest_id": "2115976609148834301", "result_count": 17}}